---
const evidence = [
  ['01:47:12', 'Deploy', 'checkout:v2.14.0 completed'],
  ['01:47:28', 'Metric', 'DB connections reached 100 / 100'],
  ['01:48:02', 'Logs', 'pool exhausted · 84 occurrences'],
];
---
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="shell hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Open source incident intelligence</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">Pamawas.<br /><em>Know what happened.</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-body">Pamawas groups alert floods into traceable incidents, then produces evidence-classified findings: what happened, what may have caused it, and what an engineer should check next.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="#investigation">Explore an investigation <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="#quick-start">Run locally <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <article class="brief-shell" aria-label="Representative Pamawas incident brief">
      <header class="brief-toolbar">
        <div><span class="status-dot"></span><span>Representative example · INC-892</span></div>
        <time>02:06 UTC</time>
      </header>
      <div class="brief-title-row">
        <div><span class="severity">High</span><span class="confidence">87% confidence</span></div>
        <h2>Checkout errors followed a connection ceiling.</h2>
        <p>In this illustrative investigation, database pool exhaustion after release v2.14.0 is classified as the likely cause.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="evidence-list">
        {evidence.map(([time, type, text]) => <div><time>{time}</time><span>{type}</span><p>{text}</p></div>)}
      </div>
      <footer class="brief-footer">
        <div><strong>42</strong><span>alerts correlated</span></div>
        <div><strong>1</strong><span>incident</span></div>
        <div><strong>0</strong><span>write actions</span></div>
      </footer>
    </article>
  </div>
  <div class="shell proof-strip" aria-label="Product principles">
    <span>Deterministic correlation</span><span>Bounded investigation</span><span>Explicit unknown outcomes</span><span>MIT licensed</span>
  </div>
</section>
